# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for scripts/e2e_guide_scenarios.py and
# scripts/e2e_persistence.py (#142).
#
# Each entry is a known, reported finding in code this e2e run does not change, kept as narrow
# as UBSan allows (one check in one function), so that every other report still fails CI.
# Remove an entry with the fix for its finding.
#
# All of them are one finding, inherited from PHD2: `pFrame = new MyFrame()` (phd.cpp) sets the
# global pFrame only after MyFrame's constructor returns, but that constructor already builds
# objects that call member functions through pFrame, so each call is a member call on a null
# pointer, once per startup. It is undefined behaviour but harmless in practice, because none of
# these MyFrame members reads `this`:
#   SetMultiStarMode      pFrame->NotifyGuidingParam  (guider_multistar.cpp, from LoadProfileSettings)
#   TargetWindow          pFrame->MakeSpinCtrlDouble  (target.cpp)
#   GuiderMultiStarConfigDialogCtrlSet  pFrame->MakeSpinCtrl / MakeSpinCtrlDouble (guider_multistar.cpp)
#   ScopeConfigDialogCtrlSet            pFrame->MakeSpinCtrl  (scope.cpp)
#   Scope::SetMaxRaDuration, SetMaxDecDuration, SetDecGuideMode
#                         pFrame->NotifyGuidingParam  (scope.cpp, from Scope's constructor)
# The ScopeConfigDialogCtrlSet and GuiderMultiStarConfigDialogCtrlSet ones run from AdvancedDialog's
# constructor, inside MyFrame's. The Scope ones run when the profile selected at startup has a mount,
# which GearDialog's constructor, inside MyFrame's, then creates: scripts/e2e_persistence.py restarts
# the daemon on such a profile.
#
# The CI build also leaves out -fsanitize=vptr: GCC's vptr check reads the object's vptr right
# after a null report it was told to continue past, so a suppressed null member call would crash
# inside the check itself (SEGV at address 0 in SetMultiStarMode).
null:GuiderMultiStar::SetMultiStarMode
null:TargetWindow::TargetWindow
null:GuiderMultiStarConfigDialogCtrlSet::GuiderMultiStarConfigDialogCtrlSet
null:ScopeConfigDialogCtrlSet::ScopeConfigDialogCtrlSet
null:Scope::SetMaxRaDuration
null:Scope::SetMaxDecDuration
null:Scope::SetDecGuideMode
